    "title": "Pixel Shimeji - Desktop Pet",
    "description": "Don't have desktop pets on your phone yet?\r\n\r\nPixel Shimeji - Desktop Pet lets anime characters live in your phone. Occasionally shimeji will chat and play with you.\r\n\r\nThere is no need to change the background, they can be displayed on the application.\r\n\r\nPixel Shimeji won't disappoint you. A lot of anime characters: cute characters, lively animals, and a variety of creations are waiting for you!\r\n\r\n- Many characters\r\n- Display on the upper layer of the application and will not be blocked by the application\r\n- Vote: Give us suggestions for next time\r\n- DIY: Design a pixel anime character you like\r\n- Custom name: It will like you more\r\n- There are more anime characters in coming\r\n\r\nHow to use:\r\n1. Install and open the app\r\n2. Select your favorite shimeji in the app\r\n3. Click adopt and allow the required permissions\r\n4. Your favorite cartoon villain will appear on the screen of the mobile phone",
